{
"text": "ENDORSED BYMike FitzpatrickState Central Member 4th District\"In the more than ten years I have known Peter Lumaj, he has not only remained a consistent and principled conservative, but has always been there to support fellow Republicans year after year. Whether it was a candidate for statewide office or a local candidate in a small town, Peter has provided both his time and his financial support to fellow Republicans. In 2026 Connecticut Republicans will need a unified team of principled leaders to win and then more importantly the talent to make real change once in office. For both of those challenges, Peter Lumaj is the ideal candidate for the Secretary of the State this election.\"View all endorsements →",
